<title>UK: London silver fixes at over 3-1/2 year low.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes at over 3-1/2 year low.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 425.00 cents vs 447.35 cents previously, lowest fix in since November 1993. Fell with gold and physical demand dried up. Speculator selling.</p>
<p>GOLD - Holding at lower level of $318.00/$318.50 down 30 cents. Very bearish, signs of producer selling overnight.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Weaker at $403.00/$406.00 down $7.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also easier at $174.00/$177.00 down $7.70.</p>
</text>
